     "For those interested, here is the annual survey of data mining.<div><br clear=\"all\">Regards,<br>Graham<br><br>\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Karl Rexer</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datamin...@rexeranalytics.com</a>&gt;</span><br>\n\n\nDate: 26 May 2011 04:26<br>Subject: [SPAM] Last chance to participate:  5th Annual Data Miner Survey<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datamin...@rexeranalytics.com</a><br><br>\n\n<br><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"font:inherit\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">The 2011 Data Miner Survey will close in early June.  Please participate now.  It will take about 20 minutes to complete the survey.</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">     Survey Link:  </font><a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2011-Intro2.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2011-Intro2.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479257563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mAAnVLSFZEuSEDQxiORr7\"><font face=\"Arial\"><b><span>www.RexerAnalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-2011-Intro2.html</span></b></font></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">     Access Code:  <b>RL3X2</b></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">If you have already participated, thank you.</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Please also tell other data miners about the survey.  Forward this email.  They can use the same access code.</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">The survey is conducted annually by </font><a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479257563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YtnyDL1Y2x095otLxF_bT\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span>Rexer Analytics</span></font></a><font face=\"Arial\">.  All analytic professionals are invited to participate.  Everyone’s responses are completely confidential.  All reporting of the survey findings will be done in the aggregate, and no findings will be written in such a way as to identify any of the participants.</font></div>\n\n\n\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">A summary report of the survey results will be freely available to everyone.  If you want to be sent the summary report, there will be a place at the end of the survey to leave your email address.  Questions about this research and requests for last year&#39;s 37-page summary report can be directed to <a href=\"http://us.mc5.mail.yahoo.com/mc/compose?to=Dat...@RexerAnalytics.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://us.mc5.mail.yahoo.com/mc/compose?to%...@RexerAnalytics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479257563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dLPmwNeRVi4lQzPX2Ss2K\"><span>DataMin...@RexerAnalytics.com</span></a>.  Highlights of the 2010 survey results can be viewed at </font><a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-Results-2010.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-Results-2010.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479257563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hEavzUdyYpM3cku-W7LhM\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span>http://www.rexeranalytics.com/Data-Miner-Survey-Results-2010.html</span></font></a><font face=\"Arial\">.  </font></div>\n\n\n\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Thank you</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">-- Karl Rexer, PhD</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\"><br></font></font></div>\n<div><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\">======================</font></font></i></div>\n<div><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\">Karl Rexer, PhD</font></font></i></div><font color=\"#888888\">\n<div><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\">President, Rexer Analytics</font></font></i></div>\n<div><a href=\"http://www.rexeranalytics.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rexeranalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479257563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YtnyDL1Y2x095otLxF_bT\"><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\">www.RexerAnalytics.com</font></font></i></a><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\"> </font></font></i></div>\n\n\n\n<div><i><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#3a21fc\"><span style=\"border-bottom:#366388 2px dotted\"><a href=\"tel:(617)%20233-8185\" value=\"+16172338185\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">617-233-8185</a></span></font></font></i></div></font></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br></div>\n\n\n"
